title: Barbara_LoadPhase
---
<<declare $dialoguePhase_Barbara= "">>
<<setPhase Barbara>>
<<if $dialoguePhase_Barbara == "begin">>
<<jump Barbara_Begin01>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase_Barbara == "comeback">>
<<jump Barbara_Comeback01>>
<<else>>
Barbara: Why are you here if you didn't give me any dialogue!!
<<endif>>
===
title: Barbara_Begin01
---
<<camMove Barbara_CamRig "npc">>
Barbara: Yahaha! You found my secret alcove!
<<camMove Barbara_CamRig "pc">>
You: Secret??
<<camMove Barbara_CamRig "npc">>
Barbara: Yes!
Barbara: You're the first person to come here and talk to me.
<<camMove Barbara_CamRig "pc">>
You: Oh.
<<camMove Barbara_CamRig "npc">>
Barbara: Here's a Maxwell!
<<collectMaxwell GameController>>
<<camMove Barbara_CamRig "pc">>
You: Thanks!
<<camMove Barbara_CamRig "return">>
<<getPhase Barbara "comeback">>
===
title: Barbara_Comeback01
---
<<camMove Barbara_CamRig "pc">>
You: So why does nobody come to visit you?
<<camMove Barbara_CamRig "npc">>
Barbara: Actually, I don't think any of us can move.
Barbara: We don't even have RigidBodies!!
<<camMove Barbara_CamRig "pc">>
You: Ah yes. This makes perfect sense to me.
<<camMove Barbara_CamRig "return">>
===